silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_01_record_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'RecordLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Record Leg', the record_leg_arrow is VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex: the evidence/aboutness typed arrow asserting that VetRecord_77 is about the individual Mittens.; also, In 'Record Leg', the creation_arrow witnesses the provenance of VetRecord_77: it was created from TartuClinicIntakeForm by the intake pipeline." .
